{"id": "0baccea1-b1d1-4b2e-afd5-959551f2f37e", "slug": "intelligence-core-nexora-systems", "title": "Intelligence Core | Nexora Systems", "description": "Intelligence Core Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Intelligence Core | Nexora Systems\"\ndescription: \"Intelligence Core Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#22D3EE\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#3B82F6\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Intelligence Core | Nexora Systems\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 241; favorites: 26; remixes: 8.\nTags: feature, section, animated.\n## Overview\nIntelligence Core Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nAll systems operational // Intelligence Core Powering the future with intelligent systems NEXORA.SYSTEMS provides the infrastructure, intelligence, and tools to build, deploy, and scale autonomous systems that learn, ad…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Powering the future with intelligent systems; Data Ingestion; Adaptive Routing; Secure Layer; AI Processing; Memory Grid.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #22D3EE, secondary #000000, accent #3B82F6, background #000000, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>NEXORA.SYSTEMS — Intelligence Core</title>\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest\"></script>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #000; }\n  .font-mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }\n\n  /* Grid background */\n  .grid-bg {\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 50px 50px;\n    transform: perspective(800px) rotateX(0deg);\n  }\n\n  /* Radial glow */\n  .radial-glow {\n    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.15) 0%, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.05) 30%, transparent 70%);\n    animation: breathe 4s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n  @keyframes breathe {\n    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.7; transform: scale(1); }\n    50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.05); }\n  }\n\n  /* Cube rotation */\n  .cube-container { perspective: 1200px; }\n  .cube {\n    width: 140px; height: 140px;\n    position: relative;\n    transform-style: preserve-3d;\n    animation: rotateCube 12s linear infinite;\n  }\n  .cube-face {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 140px; height: 140px;\n    border: 1.5px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.6);\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.15), rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1));\n    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.4), 0 0 30px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.3);\n  }\n  .cube-face.front  { transform: translateZ(70px); }\n  .cube-face.back   { transform: rotateY(180deg) translateZ(70px); }\n  .cube-face.right  { transform: rotateY(90deg) translateZ(70px); }\n  .cube-face.left   { transform: rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(70px); }\n  .cube-face.top    { transform: rotateX(90deg) translateZ(70px); }\n  .cube-face.bottom { transform: rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(70px); }\n  @keyframes rotateCube {\n    0%   { transform: rotateY(0deg) rotateX(15deg); }\n    100% { transform: rotateY(360deg) rotateX(15deg); }\n  }\n\n  /* Energy core inside cube */\n  .energy-core {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .energy-pulse {\n    width: 60px; height: 60px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.95) 0%, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.8) 40%, transparent 70%);\n    animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 60px 20px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.6);\n  }\n  @keyframes pulse {\n    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.9; }\n    50% { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 1; }\n  }\n\n  /* Orbital ring */\n  .orbit-ring {\n    position: absolute;\n    border: 1px dashed rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.4);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    animation: rotateRing 20s linear infinite;\n  }\n  .orbit-ring-2 {\n    position: absolute;\n    border: 1px dotted rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.3);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    animation: rotateRing 30s linear infinite reverse;\n  }\n  @keyframes rotateRing {\n    0% { transform: rotateX(70deg) rotateZ(0deg); }\n    100% { transform: rotateX(70deg) rotateZ(360deg); }\n  }\n\n  /* Orbital sweep */\n  .orbit-sweep {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 8px; height: 8px;\n    background: #22d3ee;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px 4px #22d3ee;\n    animation: sweep 4s linear infinite;\n  }\n  @keyframes sweep {\n    0% { transform: rotate(0deg) translateX(220px) rotate(0deg); }\n    100% { transform: rotate(360deg) translateX(220px) rotate(-360deg); }\n  }\n\n  /* Floating code */\n  .code-line {\n    position: absolute;\n    color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.5);\n    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    animation: floatCode 8s linear infinite;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  @keyframes floatCode {\n    0%   { transform: translateY(0px); opacity: 0; }\n    20%  { opacity: 0.8; }\n    80%  { opacity: 0.6; }\n    100% { transform: translateY(-200px); opacity: 0; }\n  }\n\n  /* Particles */\n  .particle {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 2px; height: 2px;\n    background: #22d3ee;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 4px #22d3ee;\n    animation: particleFloat 15s linear infinite;\n  }\n  @keyframes particleFloat {\n    0%   { transform: translate(0,0); opacity: 0; }\n    10%  { opacity: 1; }\n    90%  { opacity: 1; }\n    100% { transform: translate(50px, -100px); opacity: 0; }\n  }\n\n  /* Connection lines */\n  .conn-line { stroke: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.4); stroke-width: 1; fill: none; }\n  .conn-particle { animation: flowParticle 3s linear infinite; }\n  @keyframes flowParticle {\n    0%   { offset-distance: 0%; opacity: 0; }\n    20%  { opacity: 1; }\n    80%  { opacity: 1; }\n    100% { offset-distance: 100%; opacity: 0; }\n  }\n\n  /* Glow button */\n  .glow-btn {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #22d3ee, #0891b2);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.5), inset 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n    position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .glow-btn:hover {\n    transform: scale(1.03);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.8), inset 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n  }\n  .glow-btn::after {\n    content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: -100%;\n    width: 100%; height: 100%;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.4), transparent);\n    transition: left 0.6s;\n  }\n  .glow-btn:hover::after { left: 100%; }\n\n  .outline-btn {\n    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.4);\n    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.05);\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  .outline-btn:hover {\n    border-color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.8);\n    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.3);\n  }\n\n  /* Status pulse */\n  .status-dot {\n    width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #22d3ee;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px #22d3ee;\n    animation: statusPulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n  @keyframes statusPulse {\n    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n    50% { opacity: 0.4; }\n  }\n\n  /* Floating node */\n  .float-node {\n    animation: floatY 4s ease-in-out infinite;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  .float-node:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }\n  .float-node:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 1s; }\n  @keyframes floatY {\n    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }\n    50% { transform: translateY(-6px); }\n  }\n  .float-node:hover .node-icon {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.6);\n    border-color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.9);\n  }\n\n  /* Wave graph animation */\n  .wave-line {\n    stroke-dasharray: 4 2;\n    animation: waveMove 3s linear infinite;\n  }\n  @keyframes waveMove {\n    to { stroke-dashoffset: -20; }\n  }\n\n  /* Intelligent text glow */\n  .cyan-glow {\n    color: #22d3ee;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.6), 0 0 60px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.3);\n  }\n\n  /* Platform layers */\n  .platform-layer {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.15), rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.03));\n    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.3);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.2), 0 0 30px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1);\n  }\n\n  /* Wireframe flicker */\n  .wireframe {\n    animation: flicker 4s infinite;\n  }\n  @keyframes flicker {\n    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.6; }\n    50% { opacity: 0.9; }\n    52% { opacity: 0.3; }\n    54% { opacity: 0.8; }\n  }\n</style>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-black text-white overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n<div class=\"relative min-h-screen w-full overflow-hidden\">\n\n  <!-- Grid Background -->\n  <div class=\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-50\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Radial Glow -->\n  <div class=\"absolute inset-0 radial-glow\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Particles -->\n  <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" id=\"particles\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Vignette -->\n  <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 30%, rgba(0,0,0,0.8) 100%);\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Navbar -->\n  <nav class=\"relative z-30 flex items-center justify-between px-6 lg:px-10 py-6\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n      <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34,211,238,0.2), rgba(34,211,238,0.05)); border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.4); box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(34,211,238,0.3);\">\n        <i data-lucide=\"hexagon\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-white\">NEXORA.SYSTEMS</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-8 font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-zinc-400\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-cyan-400 transition\">PLATFORM</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-cyan-400 transition\">SOLUTIONS</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-cyan-400 transition\">MODULES</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-cyan-400 transition\">DOCS</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-cyan-400 transition\">PRICING</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-cyan-400 transition\">COMPANY</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden md:block font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-zinc-400 hover:text-cyan-400 transition\">SIGN IN</a>\n      <button class=\"outline-btn font-mono text-xs tracking-widest px-4 py-2.5 text-cyan-300\">LAUNCH CONSOLE</button>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n\n\n  <!-- Hero Content -->\n  <div class=\"relative z-20 flex flex-col items-center text-center px-6 mt-8 lg:mt-6\">\n    <span class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 mb-6\">// INTELLIGENCE CORE</span>\n    <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight max-w-4xl leading-tight\">\n      Powering the future<br>\n      with <span class=\"cyan-glow italic\">intelligent</span> systems\n    </h1>\n    <p class=\"mt-6 text-base text-zinc-400 max-w-xl leading-relaxed\">\n      NEXORA.SYSTEMS provides the infrastructure, intelligence, and tools to build, deploy, and scale autonomous systems that learn, adapt, and evolve.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mt-8\">\n      <button class=\"glow-btn font-mono text-xs tracking-widest px-6 py-3.5 rounded-md text-black font-semibold flex items-center gap-2\">\n        EXPLORE PLATFORM <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"outline-btn font-mono text-xs tracking-widest px-6 py-3.5 rounded-md text-cyan-300 flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <i data-lucide=\"file-text\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i> VIEW DOCUMENTATION\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Main 3D Visualization -->\n  <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-12 lg:-mt-12 flex items-center justify-center\" id=\"coreVisual\">\n\n    <!-- Connection lines (SVG) -->\n    <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\" viewBox=\"0 0 1400 700\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n      <!-- Left lines -->\n      <path d=\"M 200,180 L 500,330\" class=\"conn-line\"/>\n      <path d=\"M 200,340 L 500,360\" class=\"conn-line\"/>\n      <path d=\"M 200,500 L 500,400\" class=\"conn-line\"/>\n      <!-- Right lines -->\n      <path d=\"M 1200,180 L 900,330\" class=\"conn-line\"/>\n      <path d=\"M 1200,340 L 900,360\" class=\"conn-line\"/>\n      <path d=\"M 1200,500 L 900,400\" class=\"conn-line\"/>\n\n      <!-- Animated particles on lines -->\n      <circle r=\"3\" fill=\"#22d3ee\" filter=\"drop-shadow(0 0 4px #22d3ee)\">\n        <animateMotion dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M 200,180 L 500,330\"/>\n      </circle>\n      <circle r=\"3\" fill=\"#22d3ee\" filter=\"drop-shadow(0 0 4px #22d3ee)\">\n        <animateMotion dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"0.5s\" path=\"M 200,340 L 500,360\"/>\n      </circle>\n      <circle r=\"3\" fill=\"#22d3ee\" filter=\"drop-shadow(0 0 4px #22d3ee)\">\n        <animateMotion dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"1s\" path=\"M 200,500 L 500,400\"/>\n      </circle>\n      <circle r=\"3\" fill=\"#22d3ee\" filter=\"drop-shadow(0 0 4px #22d3ee)\">\n        <animateMotion dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"0.3s\" path=\"M 1200,180 L 900,330\"/>\n      </circle>\n      <circle r=\"3\" fill=\"#22d3ee\" filter=\"drop-shadow(0 0 4px #22d3ee)\">\n        <animateMotion dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"0.8s\" path=\"M 1200,340 L 900,360\"/>\n      </circle>\n      <circle r=\"3\" fill=\"#22d3ee\" filter=\"drop-shadow(0 0 4px #22d3ee)\">\n        <animateMotion dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"1.3s\" path=\"M 1200,500 L 900,400\"/>\n      </circle>\n    </svg>\n\n    <!-- Left Nodes -->\n    <div class=\"absolute left-2 lg:left-12 top-0 hidden md:flex flex-col gap-12 z-20\">\n      <div class=\"float-node flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer max-w-[220px]\">\n        <div class=\"node-icon w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.4); background: rgba(34,211,238,0.05);\">\n          <i data-lucide=\"git-branch\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400\">DATA INGESTION</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed\">Real-time streams from any source</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"float-node flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer max-w-[220px]\">\n        <div class=\"node-icon w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.4); background: rgba(34,211,238,0.05);\">\n          <i data-lucide=\"route\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400\">ADAPTIVE ROUTING</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed\">AI-driven routing and load balancing</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"float-node flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer max-w-[220px]\">\n        <div class=\"node-icon w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.4); background: rgba(34,211,238,0.05);\">\n          <i data-lucide=\"shield\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400\">SECURE LAYER</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed\">End-to-end encryption and access control</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Right Nodes -->\n    <div class=\"absolute right-2 lg:right-12 top-0 hidden md:flex flex-col gap-12 z-20 items-end\">\n      <div class=\"float-node flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer max-w-[220px] flex-row-reverse\">\n        <div class=\"node-icon w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.4); background: rgba(34,211,238,0.05);\">\n          <i data-lucide=\"cpu\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-right\">\n          <div class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400\">AI PROCESSING</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed\">Parallel processing and inference</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"float-node flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer max-w-[220px] flex-row-reverse\">\n        <div class=\"node-icon w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.4); background: rgba(34,211,238,0.05);\">\n          <i data-lucide=\"database\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-right\">\n          <div class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400\">MEMORY GRID</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed\">Distributed memory and persistence</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"float-node flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer max-w-[220px] flex-row-reverse\">\n        <div class=\"node-icon w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.4); background: rgba(34,211,238,0.05);\">\n          <i data-lucide=\"link\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-right\">\n          <div class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400\">ACTION ENGINE</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed\">Execute, automate, and orchestrate</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Center Core -->\n    <div class=\"relative h-[500px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center\" id=\"coreParallax\">\n\n      <!-- Floating code -->\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" id=\"codeFloat\"></div>\n\n      <!-- Tag above cube -->\n      <div class=\"absolute top-12 z-30 px-4 py-2 rounded-md\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.4); background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\">\n        <div class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400\">NEXORA CORE</div>\n        <div class=\"font-mono text-xs text-center text-zinc-500 mt-0.5\">v3.7.2</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Cube -->\n      <div class=\"cube-container relative\" style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">\n        <div class=\"cube\">\n          <div class=\"cube-face front\"></div>\n          <div class=\"cube-face back\"></div>\n          <div class=\"cube-face right\"></div>\n          <div class=\"cube-face left\"></div>\n          <div class=\"cube-face top\"></div>\n          <div class=\"cube-face bottom\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"energy-core\">\n          <div class=\"energy-pulse\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Orbital rings -->\n        <div class=\"orbit-ring\" style=\"width: 440px; height: 440px; left: -150px; top: -150px;\"></div>\n        <div class=\"orbit-ring-2\" style=\"width: 520px; height: 520px; left: -190px; top: -190px;\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Platform layers -->\n      <div class=\"relative -mt-8 flex flex-col items-center\">\n        <div class=\"platform-layer rounded-md\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 18px;\"></div>\n        <div class=\"platform-layer rounded-md mt-1\" style=\"width: 380px; height: 22px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(34,211,238,0.2), rgba(34,211,238,0.05));\"></div>\n        <div class=\"platform-layer rounded-md mt-1\" style=\"width: 460px; height: 26px;\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Side mini cubes -->\n      <div class=\"absolute left-8 top-32 w-8 h-8 platform-layer rounded animate-pulse\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute right-8 top-32 w-8 h-8 platform-layer rounded animate-pulse\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute left-16 bottom-24 w-6 h-6 platform-layer rounded animate-pulse\"></div>\n   